// Ch1 C1-14 "Boss: Hullgnaw", its rise (O16): the children are on the plank bridge behind Rhen, the
// storm wall grows over the town behind them, and Hullgnaw comes up through the net-pen deck coiled in
// a drowned ship's rib-cage. Its wounds are spawn_wound and every mote it sheds is held (cyan,
// sinking). He fights it alone: the only one-hero boss in the game. Letterboxed, then the battle.
title: ch01_hullgnaw_rises
location: ch01/oruvel
---
@letterbox on
@camera O16
@sfx hullgnaw_ribs_creak
@vfx glimmer_held at=net_pen count=8 drift=down_seaward
@wait 1.5
Rhen [afraid]: That's a ship. That's a whole ship, and it's wearing it. #line:ch01_hullgnaw_001
@music hullgnaw fade=0.5
Rhen [determined]: I'm not scared. I'm busy. #line:ch01_hullgnaw_002
@letterbox off
===
